//   (!insideConstrainedOut branch): Implication is vacuous unless we flip to true.
//     When RenderedEndsWith(generated, "<<"), we set currentConstrainedOut := [],
//     which satisfies IsValidPrefix([]) by the method precondition. ✓
//
//   (IsCompletePrefix branch): CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut := false,
//     making the implication vacuously true. ✓
//
//   (dead-end branch): CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition guarantees
//     insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut) on both closed and open exit. ✓
//
//   (normal constrained step branch): SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep returns either eosToken
//     (we break, no state change) or a parser-valid token (hard-mask postcondition).
//     AppendConstrainedToken postcondition ensures parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
//   (final cleanup): Same CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition. ✓
//
